"note_content":"春秋左氏傳：晉郤克帥師敗齊師于鞌；師歸，范文子後入，曰：「師有功，國人喜以逆之；先入，必屬耳目焉，是代帥受名也，故不敢。」虞師、晉師滅下陽，公羊傳曰：虞，微國也，曷爲序于大國之上？使虞首惡也。帥，所類翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"春秋左氏传：晋郤克帅师败齐师于鞌；师归，范文子后入，曰：「师有功，国人喜以逆之；先入，必属耳目焉，是代帅受名也，故不敢。」虞师、晋师灭下阳，公羊传曰：虞，微国也，曷为序于大国之上？使虞首恶也。帅，所类翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"969f05dd-db0e-11ef-9468-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"969f05eb-db0e-11ef-813a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：言久繫之，則細微之事牽引以成大也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：言久系之，则细微之事牵引以成大也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"969f05ea-db0e-11ef-9a6a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"969f05ed-db0e-11ef-bd42-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"謂孟春之月，當行慶施惠，順天地生物之心，以迎和氣，不宜使獄事枝蔓。賢曰：逮，及也；辭所連及，卽追捕之也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谓孟春之月，当行庆施惠，顺天地生物之心，以迎和气，不宜使狱事枝蔓。贤曰：逮，及也；辞所连及，即追捕之也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":119,"tongjian_id":"969f05ec-db0e-11ef-9f65-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"弘農太守","official_note":"弘農太守是漢代弘農郡的最高行政長官，負責地方治理和司法。在原文中，張鳳因案件牽連被處死，顯示其職位在司法調查中受到影響。此信息基於《資治通鑑》上下文和漢代官制常識。","official_rank":"郡守級（約二千石）","source_snippet":"弘農太守張鳳","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"3388890f-fd39-47c2-81b0-a0181c978ee3"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"安平相","official_note":"安平相是漢代安平王國的行政長官，類似郡守，負責王國內政務。在原文中，楊皓同樣因案件牽連被處死，反映其職位在司法事件中的角色。此信息基於《資治通鑑》上下文和漢代官制常識。","official_rank":"王國相級（約二千石）","source_snippet":"安平相楊皓","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"964e3ed5-e7ec-4a4c-a6be-9b6f8a2a0801"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"逵","people_name_jianti_auto":"逵","people_xingming":"张逵","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"969f05ee-db0e-11ef-b0ee-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張鳳","people_name_jianti_auto":"张凤","people_xingming":"张凤","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"969f05ef-db0e-11ef-b41c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"楊皓","people_name_jianti_auto":"杨皓","people_xingming":"杨皓","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"969f05f0-db0e-11ef-8b8f-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":70,"link_death_year":141,"link_td_description":"梁商，字伯夏，安定郡乌氏县（今宁夏固原）人，东汉政治人物、外戚，官至大将军。","link_td_id":"Q10007463","link_td_number_id":4553697,"people_name":"商","people_name_jianti_auto":"商","people_xingming":"梁商","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"969f05f1-db0e-11ef-b6b3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"弘農","place_name_jianti_auto":"弘农","resolved_place_entity_id":472,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"969f05f2-db0e-11ef-b9a2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安平","place_name_jianti_auto":"安平","resolved_place_entity_id":1559,"start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"969f05f3-db0e-11ef-bb3b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/汉昭顺二帝","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。此事尤与昭帝相类。霍光忠于国，而为子禹覆其宗，梁商忠于...","context_before":"...是，但汝曹共妒之耳。”逵等知言不用，遂出矫诏收缚腾、贲。","source_end_index":274,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8489f931-69e5-4d51-81f5-e3d481357e9b","source_start_index":265,"source_text":"帝震怒，收逵等杀之"}],"path":"随笔/卷三/汉昭顺二帝","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":["内政","权争"],"content":"1春，正月，庚辰，逵等伏誅；事連弘農太守張鳳、安平相楊皓，皆坐死；辭所連染，延及在位大臣。商懼多侵枉，乃上疏曰：「春秋之義，功在元帥，罪止首惡。大獄一起，無辜者衆，死囚久繫，纖微成大，非所以順迎和氣，平政成化也。宜早訖竟，以止逮捕之煩。」帝納之，罪止坐者。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月十三日庚辰，张逵等人伏法受诛；事情牵连到弘农太守张凤、安平国相杨皓，都被处死；供词所牵连的人，进一步牵涉到在位的朝廷大臣。梁商担心多有冤枉无辜，于是上疏说：“《春秋》的义理，功勋归于元帅，罪责只处罚首恶。大案一兴起，无辜的人就会很多；长久拘押死囚，细小的过失也会酿成大案，这不是顺应春天的祥和之气、使政事平和、成就教化的做法。应当及早结案，以停止不断逮捕带来的烦扰。”顺帝采纳了他的意见，治罪只追究当事人的罪行。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，庚辰，逵等伏诛；事连弘农太守张凤、安平相杨皓，皆坐死；辞所连染，延及在位大臣。商惧多侵枉，乃上疏曰：「春秋之义，功在元帅，罪止首恶。大狱一起，无辜者众，死囚久系，纤微成大，非所以顺迎和气，平政成化也。宜早讫竟，以止逮捕之烦。」帝纳之，罪止坐者。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4392,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"969f05dc-db0e-11ef-8846-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"969f05f9-db0e-11ef-a55b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"969f05fa-db0e-11ef-8927-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：甲十六行本「安」作「守」；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：甲十六行本「安」作「守」；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"969f05f8-db0e-11ef-a3e4-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"969f05f7-db0e-11ef-8e86-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"齊","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"969f05fc-db0e-11ef-885b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"慶封","people_name_jianti_auto":"庆封","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"969f05fd-db0e-11ef-a59a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晏子","people_name_jianti_auto":"晏子","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"969f05fe-db0e-11ef-8ac1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"子尾","people_name_jianti_auto":"子尾","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"969f05ff-db0e-11ef-b4ff-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"慶氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"庆氏","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"969f0600-db0e-11ef-ba4a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鄁殿","place_name_jianti_auto":"鄁殿","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"969f0601-db0e-11ef-be41-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄁殿","place_name_jianti_auto":"鄁殿","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"969f0602-db0e-11ef-9151-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄁殿","place_name_jianti_auto":"鄁殿","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"969f0603-db0e-11ef-9369-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"左傳：齊討慶封，與晏子鄁殿，其鄙六十；弗受。子尾曰：「富，人之所欲也，何故弗受？」對曰：「慶氏之邑足欲，故亡。吾邑不足欲也，益之以鄁殿，乃足欲，亡無日矣！不受鄁殿，非惡富也，恐失富也。」鄁，蒲對翻。殿，多薦翻，又如字。","note_content_jianti_auto":"左传：齐讨庆封，与晏子鄁殿，其鄙六十；弗受。子尾曰：「富，人之所欲也，何故弗受？」对曰：「庆氏之邑足欲，故亡。吾邑不足欲也，益之以鄁殿，乃足欲，亡无日矣！不受鄁殿，非恶富也，恐失富也。」鄁，蒲对翻。殿，多荐翻，又如字。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"969f05fb-db0e-11ef-bf36-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"公儀休","people_name_jianti_auto":"公仪休","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"969f0606-db0e-11ef-a6de-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魯","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"969f0607-db0e-11ef-9b99-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"公儀休爲魯相；客有遺相魚者，相不受。客曰：「聞君嗜魚，遺君魚，何故不受也？」相曰：「以嗜魚，故不受也。今爲相能自給魚；受魚而免，誰復給我魚者！故不受也。」","note_content_jianti_auto":"公仪休为鲁相；客有遗相鱼者，相不受。客曰：「闻君嗜鱼，遗君鱼，何故不受也？」相曰：「以嗜鱼，故不受也。今为相能自给鱼；受鱼而免，谁复给我鱼者！故不受也。」","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"969f0605-db0e-11ef-9be4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"梁商","people_name_jianti_auto":"梁商","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"969f0609-db0e-11ef-a227-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"梁商之讓，通經、傳之力也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"梁商之让，通经、传之力也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"969f0608-db0e-11ef-8cb8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"虎賁中郞將","official_note":"虎賁中郞將是漢代禁軍將領，負責宮廷護衛，屬於中央軍事職務。在原文中，商少子不疑原任此職，後被改任為步兵校尉，顯示職務變動。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"商少子虎賁中郞將不疑","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"dc87f761-4a0c-4de9-9e90-b29da77bc503"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"步兵校尉","official_note":"步兵校尉是漢代軍職，掌管步兵部隊，屬於中央或地方軍事指揮官。在原文中，皇帝任命不疑為此職，但商上書辭讓，後改任為侍中、奉車都尉。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"不疑爲步兵校尉","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"ad8b268f-4870-410c-a9bd-1f36f6d4f53e"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"侍中","official_note":"侍中是漢代高級官職，掌管宮廷事務和詔命，常為皇帝近臣。在原文中，不疑最終被任命為侍中，顯示其職位提升至更核心的宮廷職務。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以不疑爲侍中","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"adc2097b-6d96-45e2-a6a9-18be385e93a1"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"奉車都尉","official_note":"奉車都尉是漢代官職，負責管理皇帝車駕，屬於宮廷軍事或儀仗職務。在原文中，不疑同時被任命為侍中和奉車都尉，可能表示其兼職或晉升。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"侍中、奉車都尉","start_index":81,"tongjian_id":"61a72103-148e-4619-9762-319ec6509523"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":70,"link_death_year":141,"link_td_description":"梁商，字伯夏，安定郡乌氏县（今宁夏固原）人，东汉政治人物、外戚，官至大将军。","link_td_id":"Q10007463","link_td_number_id":4553697,"people_name":"商","people_name_jianti_auto":"商","people_xingming":"梁商","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"969f060c-db0e-11ef-81e4-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":101,"link_death_year":156,"link_td_description":"梁不疑，又名藉，安定郡烏氏縣（今寧夏固原）人，東漢時期外戚。","link_td_id":"Q10007466","link_td_number_id":803463,"people_name":"不疑","people_name_jianti_auto":"不疑","people_xingming":"梁不疑","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"969f060d-db0e-11ef-9999-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":70,"link_death_year":141,"link_td_description":"梁商，字伯夏，安定