],"content":"二月，帝以商少子虎賁中郞將不疑爲步兵校尉。商上書辭曰：「不疑童孺，猥處成人之位。昔晏平仲辭鄁殿以安其富，公儀休不受魚飧以定其位；臣雖不才，亦願固福祿於聖世！」上乃以不疑爲侍中、奉車都尉。","content_fanyi":"二月，汉顺帝任命梁商的小儿子、虎贲中郎将梁不疑为步兵校尉。梁商上书推辞说：“梁不疑年纪尚小，难以担任成人的职位。从前，晏平仲辞让鄁殿的土地，以守护自己的富贵；公仪休不接受别人馈赠的鱼，以安定自己的高位。臣虽然没有才能，也希望在圣主之世保全自己的福禄与地位。”汉顺帝于是任命梁不疑为侍中、奉车都尉。","content_jianti_auto":"二月，帝以商少子虎贲中郞将不疑为步兵校尉。商上书辞曰：「不疑童孺，猥处成人之位。昔晏平仲辞鄁殿以安其富，公仪休不受鱼飧以定其位；臣虽不才，亦愿固福禄于圣世！」上乃以不疑为侍中、奉车都尉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4393,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"969f05f5-db0e-11ef-9213-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","resolved_place_entity_id":56,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"969f0615-db0e-11ef-ad2d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"2三月，乙亥，京師地震。","content_fanyi":"三月初九日乙亥，京师洛阳发生地震。","content_jianti_auto":"2三月，乙亥，京师地震。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4394,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"969f0614-db0e-11ef-a0ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"復，扶又翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"复，扶又翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"969f0617-db0e-11ef-a171-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"護羌校尉","official_note":"護羌校尉是